Package: infercalcR
Type: Package
Title: Statistical Inference and Diagnostic Calculations
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", , "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Provides explicit statistical procedures, descriptive
    summaries, diagnostic calculations and a common result contract. Each
    procedure is chosen through an explicit method specification rather
    than by data-driven pretests, and returns finalized estimates,
    intervals and p-values together with metadata that records the method
    identity and numerical provenance. Includes Boschloo's unconditional
    test for two-by-two tables (Boschloo, 1970,
    <doi:10.1111/j.1467-9574.1970.tb00104.x>), diagnostic accuracy and classifier
    metrics, and distribution calculators. Standard R methods are used
    where available; optional backends such as 'lme4', 'nlme' and
    'geepack' are used only when installed.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
